(6047108, 0, 'Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house.', 'Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047142, 0, 'Tell me about Herbalism.', 'Tell me about Herbalism.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047130, 0, 'Herbalism allows you to locate and gather herbs from the wild. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Alchemy or Inscription professions.\nSkilled herbalists can also use their knowledge of the earth to heal themselves.', 'Herbalism allows you to locate and gather herbs from the wild. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Alchemy or Inscription professions.\nSkilled herbalists can also use their knowledge of the earth to heal themselves.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047145, 0, 'Tell me about Alchemy.', 'Tell me about Alchemy.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047133, 0, 'Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You\'ll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs.', 'Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You\'ll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047149, 0, 'Tell me about Inscription.', 'Tell me about Inscription.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047138, 0, 'Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou\'ll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors.', 'Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou\'ll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047113, 0, 'Train me in Inscription.', 'Train me in Inscription.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047107, 0, 'Tell me about production professions.', 'Tell me about production professions.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047129, 0, 'Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house.', 'Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047146, 0, 'Tell me about Blacksmithing.', 'Tell me about Blacksmithing.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047134, 0, 'Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others\' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals.', 'Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others\' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047143, 0, 'Tell me about Mining.', 'Tell me about Mining.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047131, 0, 'Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou\'ll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors.', 'Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou\'ll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047148, 0, 'Tell me about Engineering.', 'Tell me about Engineering.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047137, 0, 'Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors.', 'Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047150, 0, 'Tell me about Jewelcrafting.', 'Tell me about Jewelcrafting.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047139, 0, 'Jewelcrafting allows you to fashion magical rings, amulets, and trinkets as well as cut gems.\nThe gems used in Jewelcrafting may be purchased or acquired via Prospecting from ore gathered by Mining; for this reason the two professions pair well.\nMost Jewelcrafting designs also require a Jeweler\'s Kit while more advanced creations require a Simple Grinder; these may be purchased from Jewelcrafting vendors.', 'Jewelcrafting allows you to fashion magical rings, amulets, and trinkets as well as cut gems.\nThe gems used in Jewelcrafting may be purchased or acquired via Prospecting from ore gathered by Mining; for this reason the two professions pair well.\nMost Jewelcrafting designs also require a Jeweler\'s Kit while more advanced creations require a Simple Grinder; these may be purchased from Jewelcrafting vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047147, 0, 'Tell me about Enchanting.', 'Tell me about Enchanting.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047136, 0, 'Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors.', 'Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047111, 0, 'Train me in Enchanting.', 'Train me in Enchanting.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047152, 0, 'Tell me about Tailoring.', 'Tell me about Tailoring.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047141, 0, 'Tailoring allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, clothing, bags, spellthread, and other similar items from various types of cloth, which can be purchased or taken from slain humanoid enemies. Additional necessary materials such as threads and dyes can be purchased from trade or Tailoring vendors.\nHighly skilled tailors can also upgrade their cloaks with magical embroidery.\nEnchanters are often tailors as well, since they can disenchant the magical items they create.', 'Tailoring allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, clothing, bags, spellthread, and other similar items from various types of cloth, which can be purchased or taken from slain humanoid enemies. Additional necessary materials such as threads and dyes can be purchased from trade or Tailoring vendors.\nHighly skilled tailors can also upgrade their cloaks with magical embroidery.\nEnchanters are often tailors as well, since they can disenchant the magical items they create.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`ID`, `LanguageID`, `MaleText`, `FemaleText`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `SoundEntriesId`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(6047151, 0, 'Tell me about Leatherworking.', 'Tell me about Leatherworking.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047140, 0, 'Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor.', 'Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047144, 0, 'Tell me about Skinning.', 'Tell me about Skinning.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6047132, 0, 'Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou\'ll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.', 'Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou\'ll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049136, 0, 'Good to see you, $n!$B$BI just wanted to make sure that you appreciate all of the products that my genius has brought to the Kajaro Trading Company?$B$BThese include, but are not limited to: Kaja\'Cola, the Poultryizer, Town-In-A-Box, my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery, KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe, the Amazing G-Ray, Never-Deflating Pool Ponies, the Big Ones, Warrior-Matic NX-01, and gilgoblins. No strike that last one. Under advice of counsel, I had nothing to do with them.$B$BAnyway, I\'m working on a few more things here that I think you\'ll find interesting, such as the Micro Mechachicken and a little something I like to call Subject Nine.', '', 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049135, 0, '', 'Hey. How ya doing, boss? Hobart and I are working on some things that will ensure that you have phenomenal backup products for when the kaja\'mite runs out.$B$BThere\'s only so much of it left down there in the mines, and when it\'s gone, all of the Kaja\'Cola is going to go with it, I\'m afraid.', 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049175, 0, '', 'I don\'t talk to no $g scrub : trash;!', 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049176, 0, '', 'You\'re not quite in my league, honey.', 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049177, 0, '', 'I didn\'t talk to you back in school and I\'m sure not going to start now.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049178, 0, '', 'That\'s an interesting... "outfit" you\'re wearing.', 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049179, 0, '', 'Yes. I\'d love a refill. Fetch one and be quick about it.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049180, 0, '', 'This is the Trade Prince\'s party, sweetie. Invite only!', 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049181, 0, '', '$n, right? Word of advice: don\'t let the Trade Prince catch you around here. He knows you\'re after his job.$B$BEveryone knows.', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049182, 0, '', 'A mook?! I don\'t speak to brutes. How dare you!', 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049183, 0, '', 'What are we calling you things these days? Brutes? Hobgoblins?$B$BI can\'t keep it straight. Get out of here.', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049184, 0, '', 'You\'re big and strong. But you need a bath. Go jump in the pool.', 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049185, 0, '', 'Oh no you did not just talk to me!', 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049186, 0, '', 'What smells around here? Oh, that\'d be you.$B$BBeat it!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049187, 0, '', 'What\'s your name?$B$BI guess it\'s a good thing you brutes can\'t talk. Otherwise, I\'d have to tell the Trade Prince how you annoyed me.$B$BNow scram!', 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049188, 0, '', 'Touch me one more time and I\'ll make sure that they send you to the Undermine!', 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049189, 0, '', 'Oh, you\'re just disgusting! Why is it always the ugly ones that try to pickup on me?!', 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049198, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$B$G Papa : Mama;...?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049216, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BI hunger... therefore, I am.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049217, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BWhat does "$c" mean? Are you the goblin $g patriarch : matriarch;?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049220, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BThey call you $n. Is this your unique signifier, or is it an honorary title?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049224, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BGreetings. I recently emerged from an egg. You?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049225, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BIs it true that you cook your meat? Curious.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049226, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BYou lack a helmet. Does this diminish your intellectual capacities?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6049227, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BThe ends of your fingers are dull and round. Is this why you carry around other implements for use in combat?$B$BHow interesting.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6007015, 0, 'Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already.', 'Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009684, 0, 'Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the "Expert Cookbook".', 'Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the "Expert Cookbook".', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009686, 0, 'Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.', 'Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009688, 0, 'I can teach you how to cook!', 'I can teach you how to cook!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009219, 0, 'Your skill exceeds mine, though  I\'ve heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of "The Bass and You".  That is sure to help you increase your skill.', 'Your skill exceeds mine, though  I\'ve heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of "The Bass and You".  That is sure to help you increase your skill.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009556, 0, 'You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 'You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009557, 0, 'I can teach you fishing skills.', 'I can teach you fishing skills.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009699, 0, 'The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.', 'The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009700, 0, 'I\'ve heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.', 'I\'ve heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6009701, 0, 'I can train you in First Aid techniques.', 'I can train you in First Aid techniques.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6036457, 0, 'Is this really a good idea?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6036458, 0, 'Up, Up & Away!', 'Up, Up & Away!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031758, 0, '', 'Many have fallen within Valhalas and their corpses are a testament to the strength of our ways.$B$BWill your bones litter this place of honor and battle as well, $n?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031757, 0, '', 'You have not yet proven yourself worthy enough to issue a challenge within Valhalas, $n.$B$BReturn when you have earned a name for yourself.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6032013, 0, '', 'Champion $n, it is good to see you again.$B$BHave you returned to Valhalas to assist a friend with their challenges?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6004714, 0, '%s looks up at you quizzically. Maybe you should inspect it?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6005140, 0, 'Skinning', 'Skinning', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031956, 0, 'Hardly a fitting introduction, Spear-Wife.  Now, who is this outsider that I\'ve been hearing so much about?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031957, 0, 'I will make this as easy as possible for you.  Simply come here and die.  That is all that I ask for your many trespasses.  For your sullying of this exalted place of battle.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031972, 0, 'FOR YOUR EFFRONTERY TO THE LICH KING!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6012272, 0, '%s releases the last of its energies into the nearby runestone, successfully reactivating it.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6038630, 0, '%s goes into a frenzy!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031493, 0, 'Scrying upon many insignificant situations within Icecrown, you stumble upon something interesting...', 'Scrying upon many insignificant situations within Icecrown, you stumble upon something interesting...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, -15595),
(6025215, 0, 'There is a noise from behind you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6023540, 0, '$n\'s concoction is ruined.  A new one must be created from scratch.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6023071, 0, 'The failed concoction spills on the floor and appears to come to life!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028837, 0, 'What is this you pathetic, little worm? Come to die?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028838, 0, 'I recognize your stench. You\'re the one who stealthed by me on the back of that snow leopard runt!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028833, 0, 'What? How is this possible?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028877, 0, 'Wait... STOP! You can\'t take back the power!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028855, 0, 'NOOOOooooooooooooooooo!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028832, 0, '', 'TIME TO DIE, FOOL!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028842, 0, '', 'I\'ve returned to invite you to my housewarming in the underworld!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028843, 0, '', 'I\'d say come along quietly, but we both know that\'s not going to happen. My little friend here is going to ease your way into the afterlife.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6028876, 0, '', 'Well done. I\'ll see to it that my prophet enjoys his eternal stay with me.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031744, 0, '', 'Valhalas is yours to win or die in, $n. But whatever you do, stay within the bounds of the arena. To flee is to lose and be dishonored.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031745, 0, '', '$n and $g his : her; comrades in arms have chosen to accept honorable combat within the sacred confines of Valhalas.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031746, 0, '', 'There can be only one outcome to such a battle: death for one side or the other. Let $n prove $g himself : herself; upon the bones of those outsiders who have fallen before!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031756, 0, 'The fallen heroes of Valhalas emerge from the ground to do battle once more!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031755, 0, '', '$n has defeated the fallen heroes of Valhalas battles past. This is only a beginning, but it will suffice.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031771, 0, '', 'Prepare yourself. Khit\'rix will be entering Valhalas from the southeast. Remember, do not leave the ring or you will lose the battle.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031770, 0, '', '$n has accepted the challenge of Khit\'rix the Dark Master. May the gods show mercy upon $g him : her; for Khit\'rix surely will not.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6032753, 0, 'Khit\'rix the Dark Master skitters into Valhalas from the southeast!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031820, 0, '', 'Khit\'rix the Dark Master has been defeated by $n and $g his : her; band of companions. Let the next challenge be issued!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031892, 0, '', 'Sigrid Iceborn has returned to the heights of Jotunheim to prove herself against $n.  When last they met, $n bested her in personal combat.  Let us see the outcome of this match.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6032757, 0, 'Circling Valhalas, Sigrid Iceborn approaches to seek her revenge!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031921, 0, '', '$n has defeated Sigrid Iceborn for a second time.  Well, this time $g he : she; did it with the help of $g his : her; friends, but a win is a win!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031885, 0, '', 'Carnage is coming!  Remember, no matter what you do, do NOT leave the battle ring or I will disqualify you and your group.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031930, 0, '', 'From the bowels of the Underhalls comes Carnage.  Brave and foolish $n has accepted the challenge.  $G He : She; and $g his : her; group stand ready to face the monstrosity.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6032758, 0, 'Lumbering in from the south, the smell of Carnage precedes him!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031931, 0, '', 'The horror known as Carnage is no more.  Could it be that $n is truly worthy of battle in Valhalas?  We shall see.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031938, 0, '', 'Look to the southeast and you will see the thane upon the platform near Gjonner the Merciless when he shows himself. Let him come down.  Stay within the ring of Valhalas.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031939, 0, '', 'Thane Banahogg returns to Valhalas for the first time in ages to prove that the vrykul are the only beings worthy to fight within its sacred ring.  Will $n prove him wrong?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6032760, 0, 'Thane Banahogg appears upon the overlook to the southeast!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031940, 0, '', 'Thane Banahogg the Deathblow has fallen to $n and $g his : her; fighting companions.  $G He : She; has but one challenge ahead of $g him : her;.  Who will it be?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031949, 0, '', 'It\'s too late to run now.  Do not leave the ring.  Die bravely, $n!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031951, 0, '', 'From the depths of Icecrown Citadel, one of the Lich King\'s chosen comes to put an end to the existence of $n and $g his : her; friends.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031955, 0, '', 'Warriors of Jotunheim, I present to you, Blood Prince Sandoval!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6032761, 0, 'Without warning, Prince Sandoval magically appears within Valhalas!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
(6031945, 0, '', 'The unthinkable has happened... $n has slain Prince Sandoval!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, -15595),
