(6015696, 'You did it! We\'re saved!', 'You did it! We\'re saved!', 6039625, 0, 1, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?', 'Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?', 6039626, 0, 1, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'How can I ever thank you, $N?', 'How can I ever thank you, $N?', 6039627, 0, 1, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.', 'I\'d keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There\'s a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there\'s a chance for profit and promotion.', 6039628, 0, 1, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!', 'Let\'s leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!', 6039629, 0, 1, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!', 'Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma\'am;!', 6039630, 0, 1, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.', 'I don\'t know. I think I\'m going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here.', 6039631, 0, 1, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.', 'I have an idea... this time let\'s not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI\'m just saying.', 6039632, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
