(6035054, 0, 0, 'Make sure you pull plenty of moolah out of the bank. I don\'t want you buying any of that cheap clothing you usually like to wear. This party\'s important!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 6049023, 0, 'say Text'),
(6035054, 1, 0, 'Look at you! I\'m the luckiest boyfriend on the island!!!', 42, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 6049013, 0, 'say Text'),
